Modifications: file-backed persistence under state/, an HTTP server
(src/server.ts) implementing the Procurement Integrity Investigator memory
contract, a Dockerfile, and HTTP tests. src/index.ts still exports HMEM so the
official conformance suite runs unchanged.

The vendored reference copy in services/hmem-upstream/reference is unchanged except
for its development dependency: vitest was raised from ^2.1.0 to ^4.1.12 (26 Oct 2026)
to clear security advisories in the old test toolchain. Its source and tests are as
published upstream.
